==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|kiel}}, probably borrowed from {{der|nl|gml|}}, {{der|nl|enm}}, or {{der|nl|frm}}, ultimately from {{der|nl|non|kjǫlr}}, from {{der|nl|gem-pro|*keluz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/kil/}}
* {{rhymes|nl|il}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-kiel.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|-en|kieltje}}

# bottom side of a ship: the [[keel]]

===Anagrams===
* {{l|nl|klei}}

